     3	Paths below are relative to `/Users/mac/Desktop/Terminal Bench/` unless prefixed `OUT/`. This is a read-only study. `OUT/scripts/audit_sessions.py` and `OUT/scripts/build_cases.py` reproduce the CSVs from the OpenCode DB opened with `mode=ro`; no worker, Docker job, task, or control file was changed. `S6_auto_speed/INCIDENTS.csv` already covers 20 run-level incidents; the 20 rows in `OUT/SLEEP_CASES.csv` are **session-level episodes**, not 20 new run incidents.
